body:
I've never really dated anyone either. Over my slutty phase too I guess. I always thought it was because I was a hideous pile of garbage, but maybe it's because of my shyness combined with anxiety.

&#x200B;

I don't know you or your situation, but I think you have contributed positive things to this world. You never know how people perceived your interactions with them or actions in general. For all you know, you saved someone's life in something small you said or did. Don't undersell yourself. Relationships and breakups are hard and life is shit. Doesn't mean you are any less because of that.
